0003E8r 2               ; ====================================================================
0003E8r 2               ;   Setup: the title screen
0003E8r 2               ; ====================================================================
0003E8r 2               ;   A list to walk with up and down, and left and right to change what's picked:
0003E8r 2               ;   the kind of battle, then for each seat who flies it and which ship, then the
0003E8r 2               ;   music. Fire starts.
