0008D1r 2               ; PhaseCanvas - how far the ship can reach with what's being picked now.
0008D1r 2               PhaseCanvas:
0008D1r 2  A5 70          lda PHASE
0008D3r 2  D0 10          bne @notMove
0008D5r 2  20 rr rr       jsr IsJump
