0008FAr 2               
0008FAr 2               ; AiJump - dive on a ship it could finish or one that sits still, or get away
0008FAr 2               ; when badly hurt.
0008FAr 2               AiJump:
0008FAr 2  AD E4 09       lda AI_HIDDEN
